  "statement": {
    "title": "CUDA memory information rejects a device without an explicit index",
    "body": "The torch.cuda memory-information API raises when its device argument is \"cuda\" or torch.device(\"cuda\") even though both designate the current device. Unindexed forms must report that device's free and total memory, while indexed strings, device objects, and integer indices must continue to select the requested device.",
